    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Create a premium, modern, fully responsive website for a company named \"SK Texture\", a premium exterior and interior wall texture company based in Gurugram, India.\n\nThe website should feel luxurious like Apple, Porsche, and high-end architecture studios.\n\nThe design language should focus on:\n\n\342\200\242 White backgrounds\n\342\200\242 Light beige\n\342\200\242 Stone textures\n\342\200\242 Soft shadows\n\342\200\242 Elegant typography\n\342\200\242 Smooth animations\n\342\200\242 Large architectural images\n\342\200\242 Minimalistic UI\n\342\200\242 Glassmorphism where appropriate\n\342\200\242 Premium scrolling effects\n\342\200\242 Framer-style animations\n\342\200\242 GSAP animations\n\342\200\242 Modern hover interactions\n\nDO NOT make the website look like a typical paint company website.\n\nInstead make it look like an architecture & luxury construction brand.\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nBrand\n\nCompany Name:\nSK Texture\n\nTagline:\nPremium Exterior & Interior Wall Textures Built to Last\n\nSecondary Line:\nElegant Finishes for Modern Architecture\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nHero Section\n\nFull-screen hero video showing luxury villas, apartments, commercial buildings, offices, hotels and modern architecture.\n\nOverlay text:\n\nTransform Ordinary Walls into Architectural Masterpieces.\n\nPremium Exterior & Interior Texture Solutions.\n\nButtons:\n\nGet Free Site Visit\n\nExplore Catalogue\n\nBelow hero show:\n\n15+ Years Experience\n\n500+ Projects Completed\n\n100+ Builder Clients\n\nAll India Service\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nAbout Section\n\nCreate a premium About section explaining:\n\nSK Texture has over 15 years of experience in exterior wall textures, decorative coatings, waterproofing and premium finishes.\n\nThe company has worked with builders, architects, commercial projects, schools, hospitals, villas and luxury residences.\n\nFocus on quality craftsmanship, durability, weather resistance and elegant finishes.\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nServices Section\n\nDisplay large cards with icons and animations.\n\nServices include:\n\nMarble Texture\n\nRustic Texture\n\nConcrete Finish\n\nGranules Texture\n\nParlina Finish\n\nBrick Texture\n\nSuper Fine Roller\n\nSuper Fine Spray\n\nSuper Fine Compact\n\nWaterproof Coatings\n\nHeat Reflective Coatings\n\nExterior Painting\n\nInterior Texture Finishes\n\nCommercial Building Textures\n\nVilla Exterior Finishes\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nTexture Catalogue\n\nCreate a beautiful catalogue section inspired by Apple product pages.\n\nUse masonry grid.\n\nLarge cards.\n\nHover zoom.\n\nWhen a texture is clicked:\n\nOpen full-screen modal\n\nLarge image\n\nTexture Name\n\nTexture Code\n\nDescription\n\nBest Applications\n\nRecommended Colours\n\nMaintenance\n\nSuitable for Interior/Exterior\n\nUse all catalogue textures from the uploaded PDF.\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nProjects Section\n\nThis should be the strongest section.\n\nDisplay projects in Pinterest masonry layout.\n\nFilters:\n\nResidential\n\nCommercial\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nBuilders\n\nApartments\n\nLuxury Villas\n\nEach project should contain:\n\nLarge before-after slider\n\nLocation\n\nBuilder Name\n\nArea Covered\n\nProducts Used\n\nCompletion Date\n\nCustomer Review\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nWhy Choose SK Texture\n\nAnimated statistics\n\n15+ Years Experience\n\n500+ Projects\n\n100+ Builders\n\nAll India Service\n\nPremium Quality Materials\n\nExpert Applicators\n\nWeather Resistant\n\nWaterproof Solutions\n\nHeat Reflective Coatings\n\nLong Lasting Finish\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nClient Testimonials\n\nLuxury cards\n\nLarge client photos\n\nBuilder reviews\n\nArchitect reviews\n\nVilla owner reviews\n\nCommercial project reviews\n\n5-star ratings\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nGallery\n\nPinterest masonry gallery\n\nLuxury architecture\n\nModern villas\n\nApartment facades\n\nBrick textures\n\nConcrete finishes\n\nMarble textures\n\nCommercial buildings\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nOffices\n\nHover animations\n\nLightbox\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nProcess\n\nHorizontal timeline\n\n1 Site Visit\n\n2 Consultation\n\n3 Texture Selection\n\n4 Sample Approval\n\n5 Surface Preparation\n\n6 Application\n\n7 Quality Inspection\n\n8 Project Completion\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nFAQ\n\nCreate expandable FAQ.\n\nExamples:\n\nHow long does texture last?\n\nIs it waterproof?\n\nCan it reduce wall temperature?\n\nDo you work outside Delhi?\n\nDo you provide samples?\n\nWhich texture is best for villas?\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nContact Section\n\nBeautiful premium section with Google Maps.\n\nPhone:\n9811221010\n7982399273\n\nEmail:\nsktexture1@gmail.com\n\nLocation:\n303, The Solitaire Plaza, Gurugram\n\nWebsite:\nwww.sktexture.com\n\nButtons:\n\nCall Now\n\nWhatsApp\n\nGet Quote\n\nBook Site Visit\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nFooter\n\nElegant footer\n\nQuick Links\n\nServices\n\nProjects\n\nCatalogue\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nCopyright\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nExtra Features\n\nDark mode toggle\n\nFloating WhatsApp button\n\nSticky navigation\n\nAnimated counters\n\nPage transition animations\n\nLazy loading\n\nSEO optimized\n\nSchema markup\n\nFast loading\n\nResponsive on mobile\n\nModern loading animation\n\nSmooth scrolling\n\nImage optimization\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nTech Stack\n\nNext.js\n\nReact\n\nTypeScript\n\nTailwind CSS\n\nFramer Motion\n\nGSAP\n\nShadcn UI\n\nReact Icons\n\nEmbla Carousel\n\nLenis Smooth Scroll\n\nLightbox Gallery\n\nResponsive\n\nSEO Optimized\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nThe overall design should look better than Asian Paints, Birla White, Berger Paints, and Indigo Paints websites.\n\nThe website should instantly create trust among builders, architects and high-end residential clients.\n\nEvery section should feel luxurious, premium and modern. "
    items {
      text: "Create a premium, modern, fully responsive website for a company named \"SK Texture\", a premium exterior and interior wall texture company based in Gurugram, India.\n\nThe website should feel luxurious like Apple, Porsche, and high-end architecture studios.\n\nThe design language should focus on:\n\n\342\200\242 White backgrounds\n\342\200\242 Light beige\n\342\200\242 Stone textures\n\342\200\242 Soft shadows\n\342\200\242 Elegant typography\n\342\200\242 Smooth animations\n\342\200\242 Large architectural images\n\342\200\242 Minimalistic UI\n\342\200\242 Glassmorphism where appropriate\n\342\200\242 Premium scrolling effects\n\342\200\242 Framer-style animations\n\342\200\242 GSAP animations\n\342\200\242 Modern hover interactions\n\nDO NOT make the website look like a typical paint company website.\n\nInstead make it look like an architecture & luxury construction brand.\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nBrand\n\nCompany Name:\nSK Texture\n\nTagline:\nPremium Exterior & Interior Wall Textures Built to Last\n\nSecondary Line:\nElegant Finishes for Modern Architecture\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nHero Section\n\nFull-screen hero video showing luxury villas, apartments, commercial buildings, offices, hotels and modern architecture.\n\nOverlay text:\n\nTransform Ordinary Walls into Architectural Masterpieces.\n\nPremium Exterior & Interior Texture Solutions.\n\nButtons:\n\nGet Free Site Visit\n\nExplore Catalogue\n\nBelow hero show:\n\n15+ Years Experience\n\n500+ Projects Completed\n\n100+ Builder Clients\n\nAll India Service\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nAbout Section\n\nCreate a premium About section explaining:\n\nSK Texture has over 15 years of experience in exterior wall textures, decorative coatings, waterproofing and premium finishes.\n\nThe company has worked with builders, architects, commercial projects, schools, hospitals, villas and luxury residences.\n\nFocus on quali