-----------------------------------------\n\nGallery\n\nPinterest masonry gallery\n\nLuxury architecture\n\nModern villas\n\nApartment facades\n\nBrick textures\n\nConcrete finishes\n\nMarble textures\n\nCommercial buildings\n\nSchools\n\nHospitals\n\nOffices\n\nHover animations\n\nLightbox\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nProcess\n\nHorizontal timeline\n\n1 Site Visit\n\n2 Consultation\n\n3 Texture Selection\n\n4 Sample Approval\n\n5 Surface Preparation\n\n6 Application\n\n7 Quality Inspection\n\n8 Project Completion\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nFAQ\n\nCreate expandable FAQ.\n\nExamples:\n\nHow long does texture last?\n\nIs it waterproof?\n\nCan it reduce wall temperature?\n\nDo you work outside Delhi?\n\nDo you provide samples?\n\nWhich texture is best for villas?\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nContact Section\n\nBeautiful premium section with Google Maps.\n\nPhone:\n9811221010\n7982399273\n\nEmail:\nsktexture1@gmail.com\n\nLocation:\n303, The Solitaire Plaza, Gurugram\n\nWebsite:\nwww.sktexture.com\n\nButtons:\n\nCall Now\n\nWhatsApp\n\nGet Quote\n\nBook Site Visit\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nFooter\n\nElegant footer\n\nQuick Links\n\nServices\n\nProjects\n\nCatalogue\n\nAbout\n\nContact\n\nInstagram\n\nFacebook\n\nLinkedIn\n\nCopyright\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nExtra Features\n\nDark mode toggle\n\nFloating WhatsApp button\n\nSticky navigation\n\nAnimated counters\n\nPage transition animations\n\nLazy loading\n\nSEO optimized\n\nSchema markup\n\nFast loading\n\nResponsive on mobile\n\nModern loading animation\n\nSmooth scrolling\n\nImage optimization\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nTech Stack\n\nNext.js\n\nReact\n\nTypeScript\n\nTailwind CSS\n\nFramer Motion\n\nGSAP\n\nShadcn UI\n\nReact Icons\n\nEmbla Carousel\n\nLenis Smooth Scroll\n\nLightbox Gallery\n\nResponsive\n\nSEO Optimized\n\n---------------------------