,\n    rating: 5,\n    quote: \"The raw concrete board-formed finish and rustic sand texture on our farmhouse elevation survived two heavy monsoons without a single water stain or crack. Truly built to last.\",\n    projectType: \'Farmhouse Restoration\'\n  }\n];\n"
