  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now outlining the UI component structure. I\'m starting by identifying the specific components needed, such as a sticky, luxurious Navbar with branding, navigation links, and a theme switch. Then I\'m working through a Hero section, envisioning full-screen architectural imagery.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Sets**\n\nI\'ve been fleshing out the Hero section with a reel or video, plus overlay controls, tagline, CTA buttons, and a trust metrics bar. I\'m also now designing the About section, focusing on brand narrative, 15 years of experience, and an interactive texture application breakdown with layered tab toggles. Next up, I\'ll be working on large cards for services, and a Texture Catalogue in the style of an Apple product page. Finally, a Pinterest-inspired Projects section is on the horizon, with before/after sliders.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on interactive components, specifically. I have conceived a Visualizer for wall textures, allowing users to preview textures on room templates. I\'ve also created a Calculator for area estimation and cost, with a quote request feature. In the works are the \"Why Choose Us\" section with animated stats, testimonials, a Pinterest-style gallery and a horizontal process timeline.\n\n\n**Outlining Section Flows**\n\nI\'m now detailing the project flow as a timeline. I\'ve also outlined components like the FAQ with expandable accordions, a premium Contact section with various communication links, and a luxury architectural Footer. Then I\'m planning several modals: Site Visit, Texture, Project, and Lightbox.\n\n\n"
