  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Initial Requirements**\n\nI\'ve successfully compiled the applet. Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing the initial requirements from the prompt to ensure complete coverage. I\'m focusing on the branding details, including the company name, tagline, and secondary line, to guarantee all aspects are captured accurately.\n\n\n**Defining Visual Style**\n\nI am now delving into the visual aesthetic, drawing inspiration from Apple, Porsche, and architectural design studios. I am visualizing a luxuriously minimalist design with white and beige backgrounds, stone textures, and soft shadows. The plan includes elegant typography, smooth motion, large architectural images, a glassmorphism header, and Framer/GSAP-style interactions.\n\n\n**Outlining Service Details**\n\nI am now structuring the \"Services\" and \"Texture Catalogue\" sections. I\'m prioritizing quality craftsmanship and durability for all listed services, highlighting weather resistance and elegant finishes. The interactive coating breakdown system is also being outlined, with focus on the interactive layers. The goal is to provide a user-friendly and visually appealing experience with vector icons, category filters, and detail modals. The texture catalog will use an Apple-inspired layout with large cards, hover zoom, and a full-screen modal for detailed information.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have created a premium, modern, fully responsive website for **SK Texture**, designed with an architectural aesthetic inspired by Apple, Porsche, and high-end design studios.\n\n### Design & Architectural Highlights\n\n- **Visual Identity**:\n  - **Refined Palette**: Warm limestone tones, off-white canvases, subtle stone textures, dark luxury accents, and soft architectural drop-shadows.\n  - **Typographic Pairings**: Serif display headings paired with clean, tracked-out sans-serif body text and monospaced specification tags.\n  - **Dual Mode**: Light and Dark mode toggle with glassmorphism sticky header.\n\n- **Hero & Trust Section**:\n  - Full-screen architectural hero featuring luxury villa facades, high-rise residential towers, and corporate headquarters.\n  - Prominent overlay headline: *\"Transform Ordinary Walls into Architectural Masterpieces\"* and CTA triggers for site visits and catalogue exploration.\n  - Trust metric stats bar featuring **15+ Years Experience**, **500+ Projects Completed**, **100+ Builder Clients**, and **All India Service**.\n\n- **Interactive 4-Layer Application Breakdown**:\n  - An interactive technical tab engine explaining SK Texture\'s 4-coat protection system (*Anti-Damp Silicate Primer* \342\206\222 *Elastomeric Base Coat* \342\206\222 *SK Mineral Texture Matrix* \342\206\222 *Aquastop Hydrophobic Nano Sealer*).\n\n- **All 15 Signature Texture Services**:\n  - Dedicated cards with vector icons, category filters, search input, and technical specification drawers for:\n    1. *Marble Texture*\n    2. *Rustic Texture*\n    3. *Concrete Finish (Board-Formed Fairface)*\n    4. *Granules Texture*\n    5. *Parlina Finish*\n    6. *Brick Texture*\n    7. *Super Fine Roller*\n    8. *Super Fine Spray*\n    9. *Super Fine Compact*\n    10. *Waterproof Coatings*\n    11. *Heat Reflective Coatings*\n    12. *Exterior Painting*\n    13. *Interior Texture Finishes*\n    14. *Commercial Building Textures*\n    15. *Villa Exterior Finishes*\n\n- **Apple-Inspired Texture Catalogue**:\n  - Masonry grid layout with code badges (e.g. `SK-MRB-01`, `SK-CNC-02`, `SK-TRV-09`).\n  - Full-screen Apple-style detail modal featuring large high-res images, interactive color swatches, tactile ratings, thickness metrics, best applications, and maintenance instructions.\n\n- **Projects Section with Interactive Before-After Slider**:\n  - Pinterest-style masonry layout filterable by *Residential, Commercial, Schools, Hospitals, Builders, Apartments, and Luxury Villas*.\n  - Every project card features an interactive **drag-to-compare slider** comparing raw wall conditions to the final SK Texture finish, alongside location, builder name, area covered, products used, completion date, and verified reviews.\n\n- **Interactive Wall Texture Studio & Cost Estimator**:\n  - **Wall Studio**: Select living rooms, villa facades, or corporate lobbies, pick any SK texture product and color swatch, and render the wall in real-time.\n  - **AI Area & Cost Estimator**: Calculate surface area in sq. ft., select texture finish tiers, and calculate instant budget and application timelines.\n\n- **8-Step Timeline, FAQ, & Contact Section**:\n  - Horizontal process timeline from *1. Site Visit* to *8. Handover with Warranty*.\n  - Searchable FAQ accordions addressing waterproofing, heat reflection, sample delivery, and Pan-India coverage.\n  - Contact section featuring direct phone links (`9811221010`, `7982399273`), email (`sktexture1@gmail.com`), website (`www.sktexture.com`), Gurugram location (`303, The Solitaire Plaza`), interactive Google Map embed, and direct WhatsApp CTA."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 166561746
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
