    thinking: "**Elevating the Design**\n\nI\'m now focused on significantly elevating the website\'s design. The previous iteration, while good, doesn\'t quite hit the mark for a luxurious, ultra-premium feel. I\'m aiming for an aesthetic similar to Apple or Porsche \342\200\223 architectural, breathtaking. The current plan involves iterating on the visual concepts.\n\n\n**Inspecting the Constraints**\n\nI\'ve been meticulously inspecting the project constraints now, which are now becoming the central focal point. I\'m focusing on \"SK Texture\" and identifying the design language for their brand. It\'s becoming clearer how to achieve that elite architecture and bespoke luxury construction studio feeling. I\'ve begun to list the specifics of the design language for this website.\n\n\n**Refining the Hero**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the hero section. I\'m thinking of a high-end architectural display, incorporating background switching \342\200\223 video or images of villas, concrete, travertine, all in high-contrast. Ultra-refined typography, tracked subtitles, and glowing CTA buttons are key. There should also be a floating \"Material Specifier\" preview card. A statistics ticker with subtle gold accents will provide some extra flair.\n\n\n"
