  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining The Website Goals**\n\nI\'m focused on the user\'s feedback. I\'m prioritizing simplifying the website and eliminating any \"fake\" or unnecessary elements that create an unrealistic presentation. I understand the core function is the catalogue, so I\'m concentrating on that aspect and ensuring it\'s the primary focus of the site, presenting the projects without extraneous additions.\n\n\n**Verifying Catalog Consistency**\n\nNow, I\'m meticulously comparing the PDF catalog to the physical brochure. My priority is absolute accuracy. I\'m cross-referencing page elements, product descriptions, and particularly the all-important swatch numbers to ensure perfect alignment between the digital and physical representations. The goal is an exact replica of the physical brochure\'s structure and information.\n\n\n**Defining Website Scope**\n\nI\'ve clarified the website\'s scope based on user feedback. My current focus is a clean, realistic, and elegant site. I\'m prioritizing two key elements: a concise introduction to SK Texture (\"Premium Exterior & Interior Textures Built to Last - All India Service & Supply Available\") and a focused Products & Swatch Catalogue. This catalog will feature the eight core product lines (Marble, Rustic, etc.) and a high-resolution swatch gallery reflecting the physical samples.\n\n\n"
