  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Site Aesthetics**\n\nOkay, I\'m working on the website\'s aesthetic, aiming for a realistic and elegant feel, directly addressing the user\'s feedback. Currently, I\'m focusing on grounding the design and ensuring it aligns perfectly with the user\'s \"simple website\" request. I am striving for a natural and believable presentation of the provided catalog.\n\n\n**Simplifying Core Website**\n\nI\'ve taken the feedback to heart and am now ruthlessly removing anything superfluous. The visualizer and calculator are out. My focus is streamlining the navigation to be clear and realistic, and the page layout is going to be intentionally clean and unadorned. I\'m making sure it is super easy to get to the core catalog, as well as easy to find information about our company. The goal is to avoid unnecessary components.\n\n\n**Developing Catalog Components**\n\nNow I\'m designing the catalog components. I\'m focusing on texture designs like concrete and brick, and specialty features like heat-reflecting coatings. I\'m also implementing the physical swatch card display, where users can see high-res details and request samples. I\'m adding application icons and swatch numbers for clarity. Finally, I\'m working on a projects showcase to display realistic applications.\n\n\n"
